  "whyPlay": "Ooblets is what happens when Pokémon meets Stardew Valley meets a dance battle. It's weird, colorful, and deeply charming. You collect creatures, grow them from seeds, and battle through dance-offs. The writing is genuinely funny, and the game never takes itself too seriously. It's the perfect palate cleanser between heavier strategy games.",
  "whyPlayZh": "《Ooblets》是宝可梦遇上星露谷遇上跳舞对决。它又怪又多彩又无比有魅力。你收集生物、从种子种出来、通过斗舞对战。剧本真的好笑，游戏从不把自己当回事。它是重策略游戏之间完美的调味剂。"
